{% doc %}
  @prompt
    now i need two parallel sections:
    both sections should have text boxes that alignment can be adjusted. the left section needs to have a boarder around each section. The right side should have an option or video as the background of each section.
    Left section:  
    Main Title center aligned: Your Goal (s)
    - Title: Build Culture & Connection
    sub: From offsites to all-hands, create experiences that matter—co-created artifacts that spark belonging.
    -Title: Engage Customers & Audiences
    Sub: Turn booths and brand moments into experiences that matter—lines people want to stand in.
    -Title: Celebrate Milestones
    Sub: Recognition that matters—tangible pieces people keep on their desk.
    -Title: Build Purposeful Partnerships
    Sub: Co-create experiences that matter—align CSR, brand, and community impact.
    on the right side 
    Main title: What We Offer
    All the sections should have an image or video as the background each section 
    - title: Fan & Community Activation's
    sub: From murals to on-site pin-making, fans create custom keepsakes using meaningful materials. Built for stadiums, festivals, and brand moments that last. 
    -title: Unique Branded Gifts
    sub: Create custom accessories using materials that matter. Moments, even graffiti. One of a kind keepsakes that turn memories into something you can wear.
    - title: Amy Peterson Speaking 
    Sub: Available for panels, keynotes, leadership summits, and corporate events , only the right side should have a image or video background option, I should be able to change the alignment of all the text sections , the left section should have an option to have a square boarder and to change the color of the boarder
    
    , the sections should be the same size and add a fourth section to the right side, I want to be able to change the background color of this section
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-parallel-sections-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: {{ block.settings.section_gap }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding }}px;
    max-width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
  }

  .ai-parallel-sections-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.item_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-parallel-sections-main-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.main_title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.main_title_margin }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.main_title_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-parallel-sections-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.item_padding }}px;
    position: relative;
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 150px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.left_item_background }};
    {% if block.settings.show_left_border %}
      border: {{ block.settings.border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-parallel-sections-item-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.item_padding }}px;
    position: relative;
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 150px;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-parallel-sections-item-right-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.overlay_opacity }});
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-parallel-sections-item-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-parallel-sections-item-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.item_title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.title_margin }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-parallel-sections-item-title-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.item_title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.title_margin }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.right_text_color }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.right_text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-parallel-sections-item-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-parallel-sections-item-subtitle-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.right_text_color }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.right_text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-parallel-sections-video-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .ai-parallel-sections-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    min-height: 150px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-parallel-sections-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-parallel-sections-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_gap }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-parallel-sections-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-parallel-sections-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.left_main_title != blank %}
